{"slug": "vrijheidsbond-feest-in-dierentuin", "synopsis": "This silent 1922 film records a Vrijheidsbond campaign gathering connected with that year\u2019s election for the Dutch House of Representatives and documented as a celebration at a zoo. Uniformed officers lead a street procession of marchers carrying flags, while large crowds gather around an ornate bandstand.\\\\n\\\\nMusicians sit on the bandstand as several men stand before the audience, and posters list scheduled speakers and times. The final sequence consists of posed views of a man outdoors, two women standing together, and another man reading papers at a desk.", "clips": [{"id": "cf9d58f8-3fbb-539e-8693-03b3c5b1eb00", "sourceSlug": "vrijheidsbond-feest-in-dierentuin", "sourceTitle": "Vrijheidsbond, feest in dierentuin", "sourceYear": 1922, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 1.04, "endSeconds": 7.08, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/vrijheidsbond-feest-in-dierentuin/clips/0000001040-0000007080.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/vrijheidsbond-feest-in-dierentuin/thumbnails/0000001040-0000007080.jpg"}, {"id": "3947784c-6e73-545f-be49-9d2d50152443", "sourceSlug": "vrijheidsbond-feest-in-dierentuin", "sourceTitle": "Vrijheidsbond, feest in dierentuin", "sourceYear": 1922, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 7.08, "endSeconds": 15.16, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/vrijheidsbond-feest-in-dierentuin/clips/0000007080-0000015160.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/vrijheidsbond-feest-in-dierentuin/thumbnails/0000007080-0000015160.jpg"}, {"id": "eebd134e-c41e-5759-829f-6ac4619dde15", "sourceSlug": "vrijheidsbond-feest-in-dierentuin", "sourceTitle": "Vrijheidsbond, feest in dierentuin", "sourceYear": 1922, "position": 3, "startSeconds": 15.16, "endSeconds": 22.56, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/vrijheidsb